Package: readjsa
Title: Access Jobs and Skills Australia Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Chartwell", family = "Macro", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com"),
    person("Matt", "Cowgill", role = "aut",
           comment = c(
             ORCID = "0000-0003-0422-3300",
             "Original readjsa 0.0.1 implementation")),
    person("Angus", "Hughes", role = "ctb"),
    person("Amee", "McMillan", role = "ctb"))
Description: Discovers, downloads, verifies, caches, and parses official Jobs
    and Skills Australia and Department of Employment and Workplace Relations
    releases: the Internet Vacancy Index (IVI), Recruitment Experiences and
    Outlook Survey (REOS), and Small Area Labour Markets (SALM). Attaches
    raw-file provenance, release vintages,
    classifications, revisions, and source terms to each observation and
    supports deterministic offline parsing of local files.
